    {
      "line": 64,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "line": 65,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 2: THE ARRIVAL"
    },
    {
      "line": 66,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 67,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The stranger came at noon on a day without clouds."
    },
    {
      "line": 68,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 69,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He walked out of the eastern badlands as though he’d always been there, his approach not seen until he was already at Ironspire’s outer gate."
    },
    {
      "line": 70,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tall—seven feet if an inch—encased in armor the color of cooled magma, heat-scarred and pitted."
    },
    {
      "line": 71,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His helm was a split-visor design, the slit glowing with a dull, ember-red light."
    },
    {
      "line": 72,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No insignia, no banner."
    },
    {
      "line": 73,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Just a heavy, weighted chain wrapped around his torso and left arm, each link engraved with a name in a script that hurt the eyes to look at."
    },
    {
      "line": 74,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 75,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The gate guards challenged him."
    },
    {
      "line": 76,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He stopped, his stillness unnatural—no shift of weight, no breath misting in the cool air."
    },
    {
      "line": 77,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 78,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Where is Geralt?” he asked.",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "question",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 79,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His voice was flat, metallic, without inflection."
    },
    {
      "line": 80,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 81,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“State your business,” the captain said, hand on her sword.",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "speak",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 82,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 83,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“I am Karvex."
    },
    {
      "line": 84,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Ledger-Born."
    },
    {
      "line": 85,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I have come to collect a debt.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 86,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 87,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“What debt?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 88,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 89,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“The debt of unfinished stories."
    },
    {
      "line": 90,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Unpaid balances from the war."
    },
    {
      "line": 91,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gods may die."
    },
    {
      "line": 92,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Debts do not.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 93,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 94,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He wasn’t evil."
    },
    {
      "line": 95,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "There was no malice in his tone, no rage in his posture."
    },
    {
      "line": 96,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He was procedural."
    },
    {
      "line": 97,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An enforcer."
    },
    {
      "line": 98,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A cosmic bailiff."
    },
    {
      "line": 99,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 100,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Geralt isn’t here,” the captain said. “Leave.”",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "speak",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 101,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 102,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Karvex’s helm tilted slightly. “Then you will produce him."
    },
    {
      "line": 103,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Or I will begin foreclosure proceedings on this settlement.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 104,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 105,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Foreclosure?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 106,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 107,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Destruction."
    },
    {
      "line": 108,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Until he appears."
    },
    {
      "line": 109,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The contract permits it.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 110,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 111,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He took one step forward."
    },
    {
      "line": 112,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The ground didn’t shake."
    },
    {
      "line": 113,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air didn’t crackle."
    },
    {
      "line": 114,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But the certainty in that step was more terrifying than any roar."
    },
    {
      "line": 115,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 116,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Sound the alarm,” the captain whispered."
    },
    {
      "line": 117,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 118,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    }
